sec.p:
Tumor volume measurements were performed using a digital caliper (Fisherbrand) and initiated 7 days after PDX tumor inoculation. Width (W, in mm) and length (L, in mm) measurements were taken, and tumor volume (V, in mm3) was calculated using the following formula:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$V=\frac{L\,x\,{W}^{2}}{2}$$\end{document}V=LxW22
